  {
   "text": "1 Jev request \u00b7 no LLM \u00b7 \u2248 0.4 s \u00b7 cannot write free text: a question no template covers ends in a transfer",
   "x": 150,
   "y": 174,
   "font_size": 11,
   "color": "#6B7280",
   "anchor": "start"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 LLM call \u00b7 \u2248 8,000 input tokens \u00b7 \u2248 2 s \u00b7 can write anything \u00b7 pays the full call on every turn",
   "x": 150,
   "y": 304,
   "font_size": 11,
   "color": "#6B7280",
   "anchor": "start"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 Jev request \u00b7 both LLM nodes skipped this turn \u00b7 code still produces the action \u00b7 \u2248 0.4 s \u00b7 the model is called on \u2248 1 turn in 3",
   "x": 150,
   "y": 434,
   "font_size": 11,
   "color": "#6B7280",
   "anchor": "start"
  },
  {
   "text": "The same turn on each route. Customer: \u201cI\u2019m Yusuf Rossi, zip 19122, I want to exchange the keyboard in order #W2378156.\u201d",
   "x": 620,
   "y": 40,
   "font_size": 14,
   "color": "#374151",
   "anchor": "middle"
  },
  {
   "text": "Where they part: three turns later the customer asks for the specifications of the replacement items.",
   "x": 620,
   "y": 480,
   "font_size": 12,
   "color": "#374151",
   "anchor": "middle"
  },
  {
   "text": "Jev route: no template answers, the call is transferred.   LLM route: the model writes the answer.   Mixed route: Jev picks \u201creply with the LLM\u201d and the model writes it; every other turn stays on code + Jev.",
   "x": 620,
   "y": 500,
   "font_size": 11,
